      "traits": [
        "arcane",
        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The house drake breathes a 10ft Type:cone of silver mist. Each creature within the mist must succeed at a DC 16 Will Saving Throw save or become Stupefied 2 for 1 round. The house drake can't use Silver Breath again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
