          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 willing creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You grace the target's mind, boosting its mental defenses and healing its wounds. The target regains 1d10+4 Hit Points when you Cast the Spell and gains a +2 status bonus to saves against mental effects for the duration.</p>\n<p></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing increases by 1d10+4.</p>",
